 Space Agency (ISA) has just intercepted a desperate, system-wide distress signal from the long-isolated inhabitants of Pluto. In a race against time, the nearby vessel Empress of Discovery is dispatched to respond\u2026but moments after making orbit, the ship\u2019s final transmission crackles through the void: a garbled, static-soaked mayday\u2026 then silence.\n\nNow, all eyes turn to you.\n\nAssume the role of Master Commander Lance Johnson, captain of the legendary Gilded Seeker.\n\nYour mission: investigate the Plutonian distress call, uncover the fate of the Empress and its crew, and confront whatever terror has awakened on the planet\u2019s surface. Can you stop the unknown menace before it spreads beyond Pluto\u2019s orbit?", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/swarm-hunter--1", "videos": [{"id": 151427, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "8S0DEgGBFLI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8S0DEgGBFLI", "title": "Swarm Hunter Gameplay Trailer - Flyswatter Studios", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8S0DEgGBFLI/sddefault.jpg"}]}